d",null,null,null,"Food",null,"0ahUKEwjC3N2ystKWAxXFi68BHR7mPEgQ3IcHCGsoBQ",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"Service",null,null,null,"Service",null,"0ahUKEwjC3N2ystKWAxXFi68BHR7mPEgQ3IcHCGwoBg",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"Atmosphere",null,null,null,"Atmosphere",null,"0ahUKEwjC3N2ystKWAxXFi68BHR7mPEgQ3IcHCG0oBw",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["en"],[["Food is worth the wait. Ordered the signature tofu katsu set, ebi shrimp katsu and sides of alcohol.\n\nTo start off the tofu katsu is nothing like anything I've tasted before. The tofu within is not too soft nor too firm and gives a pleasing sensation within the mouth when chewed. Accomodated with the layering of pork on the between the fried batter, it is a perfect flavor explosion that has one craving for more.\n\nAs for the ebi katsu, the shrimp is of high quality and the freshness of it can be felt once biting in. The tartar sauce and generous helping of cabbage is a nice pairing too.\n\nThe service is quick and responsive and the staff are quick to accommodate to the needs of not just us but all guests in the establishment.\n\nA must visit restaurant in the heart of Hakone.",null,[0,100]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2578752133449781898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDYmt4WWFGZFVWM2N6WW14SmVWWnRSak5qVkd4RFpESm5ORkZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2578752133449781898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDYmt4WWFGZFVWM2N6WW14SmVWWnRSak5qVkd4RFpESm5ORkZWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2578752133449781898/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBDYmt4WWFGZFVWM2N6WW14SmVWWnRSak5qVkd4RFpESm5ORkZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2578752133449781898/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhs