most an hour to get seated. I ordered the LYB pork teishoku set (miso soup, cabbage, rice). The menu highlights the pork as a premium blend (Middle Yorkshire, Berkshire, Landrace) with a low fat melting point, which sounded promising.\nBut once seated, I noticed almost every local was eating the tofu katsuni. I tried to change my order, but it was already locked in. The LYB was nothing special. Takeaway: don’t make the same mistake—order the tofu katsuni. That’s what people actually come here for, and it’s what locals are willing to line up for.",null,[0,225]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2578752133449781898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc1VW1SSFVsRlNWekExWTJwT1RWVnFVbGhaVmtaTVZUSTVUMlZHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2578752133449781898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc1VW1SSFVsRlNWekExWTJwT1RWVnFVbGhaVmtaTVZUSTVUMlZHUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2578752133449781898/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc1VW1SSFVsRlNWekExWTJwT1RWVnFVbGhaVmtaTVZUSTVUMlZHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2578752133449781898/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc1VW1SSFVsRlNWekExWTJwT1RWVnFVbGhaVmtaTVZUSTVUMlZHUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2578752133449781898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc1VW1SSFVsRlNWekExWTJwT1RWVnFVbGhaVmtaTVZUSTVUMlZHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2578752133449781898/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc1VW1SSFVsRlNWekExWTJwT1RWVnFVbGhaVmtaTVZUSTVUMlZHUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,1538,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5UmRHUlFSVzA1Y2pOTVVqUlhZVkZMVTI5T2VGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x38a2e88c27678779!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOl9RdGRQRW05cjNMUjRXYVFLU29OeFE%7C%7C?hl\u003den-US